abstract: "A scikit-learn compatible library of soft decision trees, hierarchical mixtures of experts, constructive networks and classifier comparison tests, with a PyTorch backend. The implementations start from published algorithms and depart from them where the library makes its own design choices; the original papers are listed in the repository's Citation section and should be cited alongside this software when the underlying methods are used."
